"{{Term/Store|EX Treasure: Dark Armor||Series, BotW}}" is a [[Side Quest]] in {{BotW}}.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|EX Treasure: Dark Armor}}<br/>{{Color BotW|Side Quest|Deya Village Ruins}}|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref> It is exclusive to {{TCB}} [[Downloadable Content]] Pack.

==Overview==
This [[Side Quest]] can be obtained upon leaving the [[Great Plateau]] and touching the ground of [[Hyrule Kingdom]]. This can be done by [[Warping]], reloading a save file, dying, or leaving an [[Ancient Shrine]]. When the Side Quest is activated, [[Link]] will be tasked with finding [[Misko's EX Journal 2]], which is rumored to be in the [[Deya Village Ruins]].<ref>{{Cite|Somewhere in the {{Color BotW|Red|Deya Village Ruins}} is a journal that places the location of this treasure ...|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>{{Note|It is possible to activate the second stage of this [[Side Quest]] by reading [[Misko's EX Journal 2]] without triggering any of the loading conditions for its activation.}}

Within Misko's EX Journal 2 are clues to the locations of six [[Treasure Chest]]s, each containing a priceless relic stolen from [[Hyrule Castle]] by [[Misko]].<ref>{{Cite|I hid the six priceless relics I stole from Hyrule Castle in treasure chests... I shall write down their locations. -{{Color BotW|Blue|Misko}}|Misko's EX Journal 2|BotW}}</ref> The Journal states the [[Evil Spirit Set|Phantom Ganon]] [[Armor Set]] is hidden within the forests of [[Faron (Region)|Faron]].<ref>{{Cite|The evil spirit's armor set is hidden within {{Color BotW|Red|Faron's sea of trees}}.|Misko's EX Journal 2|BotW}}</ref> The locations outlined are the highest of the three [[Waterfall]]s north of [[Lake Floria]], at the bridge that crosses [[Floria River]] between two small Waterfalls, and near the broken stone bird in [[Ebara Forest]].<ref>{{Cite|Find these pieces {{Color BotW|Red|at the highest of three waterfalls north of Lake Floria}}... {{Color BotW|Red|at the bridge between small waterfalls at Floria River}}... and {{Color BotW|Red|at the broken stone bird of Ebara Forest}}.|Misko's EX Journal 2|BotW}}</ref>

The [[Evil Spirit Mask|Phantom Ganon Skull]] can be found in a Treasure Chest submerged under the highest of three Waterfalls flowing south from [[Corta Lake]] to Lake Floria. The Treasure Chest containing the [[Evil Spirit Armor|Phantom Ganon Armor]] is submerged in the Floria River underneath [[Sarjon Bridge]]. Finally, the [[Evil Spirit Greaves|Phantom Ganon Greaves]] are in a Treasure Chest buried next to a broken stone bird statue in Ebara Forest. Each Treasure Chest can be dislodged from the ground or retrieved from the water using the [[Magnesis]] [[Rune]], allowing Link to acquire the [[Armor]] inside. The Side Quest is completed once all three pieces of the [[Evil Spirit Set|Phantom Ganon Set]] have been obtained.<ref>{{Cite|You found the treasure chest at Corta Lake, Sarjon Bridge, and Ebara Forest.<br/>You obtained the {{Color BotW|Red|Phantom Ganon set}}!|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>

